          "content": "Each icon in the editor's left bar toggles its panel; clicking the canvas or pressing Escape closes it. Import, Save as Template and Version History hide for viewers (canEdit). The drawer is 300 px wide and pushes the canvas.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "lt1dc",
          "name": "3 Screens",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "3 Screens",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "vy2Mh",
          "name": "3 Screens body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Export · Export failed · Import from Code · Save as Template · Version History · Version History load error · Settings. Base frame 1280×800, light theme.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "mzyQj",
          "name": "4 Business rules",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "4 Business rules",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "JOvUK",
          "name": "4 Business rules body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Export always renders in light mode and offers Google Drive only when Drive is connected. Import detects Mermaid or PlantUML, previews Mermaid and validates PlantUML class diagrams; “Replace existing elements” asks first. Version History lists named versions and automatic snapshots; restore and delete ask first. Canvas preferences in Settings are local to the user.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "vtLBg",
          "name": "5 Copy source",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "5 Copy source",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "k1L2E",
          "name": "5 Copy source body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "components/board-sidebar/ (ExportPanel, CodeImportPanel, SaveTemplatePanel, SnapshotPanel, SnapshotItem, SettingsPanel, SidebarDrawer) and BoardSidebar.tsx. Titles and labels are the code's; the code and version names in the drawings are sample data.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Dvs5l",
          "name": "6 States not drawn",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "6 States not drawn",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "HCs31",
          "name": "6 States not drawn body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Dark theme, the Mermaid preview and PlantUML validation states, the replace and delete confirmations (the shared ConfirmDialog), the version item menu and rename field, the preview modal, Drive export, toasts, the Share panel (see Share panel open).",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "lG3bs",
          "name": "7 Open findings",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "7 Open findings",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "wdOvW",
          "name": "7 Open findings body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "D46–D53 are fixed in code and redrawn: failures show a retry or a toast, Export errors are errors, delete and replace ask first, titles share one style, and the swatches, pills and buttons are named with a pressed state.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "B1h0c8",
          "name": "8 History",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "8 History",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "duwpH",
          "name": "8 History body",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "See the Log frame below this band.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    }
